<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <title>About | <%= siteName %></title>
  <%- include('partials/head') %>
</head>
<body>
  <%- include('partials/masthead') %>

  <main class="page page-article">
    <a class="back-link" href="/">&larr; Front Page</a>

    <article class="full-article about-page">
      <h1>About <%= siteName %></h1>

      <h2>Who owns <%= siteName %></h2>
      <p>
        <%= siteName %> is owned and published by Kamal Aslanov.
      </p>

      <h2>Where we're based</h2>
      <p>
        <%= siteName %> is based in San Diego, California.
      </p>

      <h2>What we cover</h2>
      <p>
        <%= siteName %> covers local government and public-agency news across San Diego
        County &mdash; South Bay, North County, East County, and the City of San Diego
        itself, including its constituent communities such as Pacific Beach, Ocean Beach,
        and La Jolla. Coverage includes city councils, county government, school districts,
        transit agencies, water districts, public safety agencies, and weather advisories
        issued by the National Weather Service.
      </p>

      <h2>Editorial mission</h2>
      <p>
        Our mission is to make local government and public-agency information more
        accessible to San Diego County residents by surfacing announcements, decisions,
        and advisories that often go unreported by traditional outlets, and presenting
        them in a clear, readable format.
      </p>

      <h2>How our stories are reported</h2>
      <p>
        <%= siteName %> covers local government and public-agency announcements &mdash;
        press releases, news advisories, and public notices issued directly by government
        agencies (cities, the County of San Diego, school districts, transit and water
        agencies) and by the National Weather Service. Every article is drawn from, and
        can be traced back to, a specific public announcement or advisory.
      </p>

      <h2>Corrections policy</h2>
      <p>
        We aim to accurately reflect the public source material each article is based on.
        If you believe an article contains an error, please contact us using the
        information below with the article's headline or link and a description of the
        issue. Confirmed corrections will be made promptly and noted on the affected
        article.
      </p>

      <h2>Editorial independence</h2>
      <p>
        <%= siteName %> is not owned or funded by any government agency, political
        campaign, or organization covered in its reporting, and no agency or official has
        editorial input into what we publish or how it's written.
      </p>

      <h2>Contact information</h2>
      <p>
        Phone: <a href="tel:(760)%20205-2499">(760) 205-2499</a>
      </p>
    </article>
  </main>

  <%- include('partials/footer') %>
</body>
</html>